Daśaratha gazes till Rāma dust vanishes --- Daśaratha falls seeing Rāma dust no more --- Daśaratha forbids Kaikēyī to touch him --- Daśaratha renounces Kaikēyī and Bharata offerings --- Daśaratha pictures Rāma sleeping under tree --- Daśaratha enters desolate empty Ayōdhyā --- Daśaratha enters Kausalyā house crying for Rāma --- Daśaratha cries sight follows Rāma still
